              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And those who are far off shall come and help to build the temple of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; and you shall know that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts has sent me to you. And this shall come to pass, if you will diligently obey the voice of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
